Description: Ubuntu Pro app WSL service
 The Ubuntu Pro app manages Ubuntu instances on WSL, including Ubuntu Pro
 attachment and Landscape configuration. Its Windows agent orchestrates
 instances on the host. The wsl-pro-service runs inside each instance and
 connects it to the Windows agent to apply configuration.
